@startuml
title Интеграция с Telegram

actor "Клиент в Telegram" as Client
participant "Telegram Bot API" as Telegram
participant "telegram-webhook" as Webhook
database "Postgres RPC/schema" as Db
participant "ai-orchestrator" as AI
participant "telegram-outcoming" as Outcoming

Client -> Telegram: отправляет сообщение боту
Telegram -> Webhook: POST webhook update
Webhook -> Db: process_incoming_telegram_message
Webhook -> AI: background invoke для нового client message
Webhook --> Telegram: HTTP 200

group Доставка AI response
  AI -> Db: publish_chat_ai_response inserts chat_messages(ai)
  AI -> Telegram: sendMessage напрямую
  AI -> Db: PATCH delivery_status
end

group Доставка manager response
  Db -> Db: process_manager_outcoming_message inserts chat_messages(manager, pending)
  Db -> Outcoming: pg_net HTTP trigger
  Outcoming -> Telegram: sendMessage
  Outcoming -> Db: update delivery_status
end

note bottom
  Persistence входящих и исходящих сообщений принадлежит DB/RPC.
  Delivery сейчас имеет разные runtime paths для manager и AI messages.
end note

@enduml
